kind: exclusive
reason: mistrallarge4_dump runs mainline llama.cpp on 32 CPU threads over a 233 GB mmap; beside a timed run or a gate batch
  it would take their cores and their page cache, so it holds the lease; why now: the Mix-256G file's oracle sets the
